<title>KUWAIT: KPC raises September butane, propane prices.</title>
<headline>KPC raises September butane, propane prices.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) on Sunday set higher September prices for butane and propane.</p>
<p>A KPC statement said propane will now sell for $170 a tonne, up from $160, while butane was raised by $5 a tonne to $175.</p>
</text>
